  "definition": "Exemptions",
  "effectiveDate": "2021-10-21",
  "historyNote": "#6827, eff 8-6-98; ss by #7919, eff 7-18-03; ss by #9945-A, eff 6-22-11; ss by #10864, eff 6-25-15 (from He-P 4040.05); amd by#13280, eff 10-21-21",
